	<key>readme</key>
	<string>Quick Radio: internet radio from Alfred, played with mpv.

rd                      list of your stations (last played first); type to filter by name or country, e.g. rd be
rd add NAME             add a station: suggestions from radio-browser.info appear while you type
rd add NAME URL [NL]    add a station with your own stream URL (country code optional; a copied stream URL is offered too)
rd find NAME            search stations online; Enter adds, Cmd+Enter plays right away
qr                      stop the radio (or press Enter on "Now playing" at the top of the list)

On a station:  Enter play · Cmd+Enter copy stream URL · Opt+Enter remove from your list · Ctrl+Enter open stations file

Requires mpv (brew install mpv). Other players (Spotify, Music) are paused when a station starts.
Your stations are stored in ~/Library/Application Support/Alfred/Workflow Data/nl.spinnerz.radio/stations.json</string>
